-- g7-tests-expressions: Articles 21 to 23 and their penalties.  The expected values were decided from the text of Articles 21 to 23 before this module was run (see the comment of g7-tests-fixtures-expressions, which
-- holds the 52 scenarios and the rules they exercise).

