§§ `The penalty as data (Articles 21(9), 21(10), 23(6), 23(7))`

#ASSERT `Art 21 the penalty for the contravention` `paragraph (1) of Article 21` EQUALS `the penalty of a fine of level 3 on the standard scale`
#ASSERT `Art 21 the penalty for the contravention` `paragraph (3) of Article 21` EQUALS `the penalty of a fine of level 3 on the standard scale`
